# Git in spring-test-isolation

When creating or renaming branches, drafting commit messages, committing, or amending commits:

1. **Follow [CONTRIBUTING.md](../../CONTRIBUTING.md)** in this repository. It overrides generic Conventional Commits defaults and personal skills.
2. Match recent `git log` on the branch when it clearly follows CONTRIBUTING.
3. Keep existing git safety behavior: commit only when the user asks, no push unless asked, no destructive git commands unless requested.

Default branch shape: `{type}/{short-kebab-description}`.  
Default commit shape: `type(scope): imperative description` (no space before the colon).
